# Cloudflare Pages redirects.
# STI-271: legacy /products/<handle> (still emitted by
# functions/api/checkout.js:121 as the waitlist redirectBase, and documented
# at docs/test-purchase-handoff.md:6) -> canonical /product/<handle>.
# 308 preserves the request method/body so future POST/PUT probes that
# happen to hit the legacy URL aren't dropped on the redirect.
# Last entry wins for static assets; Cloudflare evaluates top-to-bottom.
/products/:handle  /product/:handle  308
